    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds meet the response time requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The availability target of 99.9% is also achievable on the appropriate hosting tier." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration with SIH and DPI, our have standard connectors and can provide custom adapters where needed. our support health interoperability standards with our FHIR HL7 connector, which is already in production for main resources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure seamless integration with the existing hospital information system, I propose deploying our Atelier platform on the Sovereign HDS tier hosted by OuraneCloud, as our Atelier platform is SecNumCloud-qualified and meets the required standards. deploying will provide the necessary security and compliance for health data.  our API-first design with documented APIs allows for easy embedding in existing work environments, and our can integrate with the hospital's identity management system using SAML or OIDC for single sign-on and LDAP or Entra ID for user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The active-active deployment across two availability zones ensures high availability, and our built-in monitoring, logging, and observability capabilities will enable efficient operation and maintenance of the existing hospital information system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender demands strict GDPR compliance, HDS certification, encryption of sensitive data, and explainability of AI recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's security controls and experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act), what measures should our company's take to ensure the solution meets strict GDPR compliance, HDS certification, encryption of sensitive data, and explainability of AI recommendations and maintains medical confidentiality?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet demands, our company's should leverage our company's existing ISO 27001 certification, which covers development, delivery, and operations, ensuring a robust foundation for GDPR compliance. our company's experience in delivering solutions under GDPR for public-sector and health clients, including special-category health data, will also be beneficial." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For HDS certification, our company's hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud is already SecNumCloud-qualified, and our company's hold the HDS certification through our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud. our company's should ensure that our company's processing on our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud continues to adhere to the requirements of the HDS certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Encryption of sensitive data is already addressed through our company's use of TLS 1.3 for encryption in transit and AES-256 for encryption at rest, with key management handled on EU-based infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability of AI recommendations, our product Atelier supports traceability, retrieval trace, and audit logs, which will be crucial in providing transparent and understandable AI-driven decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our product Atelier is designed to support medical confidentiality, aligning with the requirements for handling sensitive health data. our should also emphasize our adherence to GDPR Article 28 through our Data Processing Agreement (DPA) and highlight our ability to maintain strict isolation between client corpora, ensuring the confidentiality and integrity of the data processed." ;
